+### Specialty directory
+
+<a id="req-specialtydirectory-001"></a>
+
+The clinic also publishes the inverse of the veterinarian directory (stated 2026-08-17). One page lists every specialty the clinic knows by its stored name, each with the veterinarians holding it. A veterinarian is shown by first name then last name. A veterinarian holding no specialty appears nowhere: this page lists specialties, not the full roster. Every specialty is on the one page, with no paging. The page is reached only by requesting its own address `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]`. Nothing in the interface links to it and no navigation entry names it; a visible entry point is a later request. The page reads records and changes none, so NG-2 stands unchanged. It offers no search or filter, so NG-9 stands unchanged.
+
+**Done when:**
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given the clinic's specialties, when the page is opened at its own address, then every one is listed by its stored name.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given a specialty that veterinarians hold, when the page is opened, then each holder is shown by first name then last name.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given a specialty no veterinarian holds, when the page is opened, then it is listed as held by none rather than omitted.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given a veterinarian holding no specialty, when the page is opened, then that veterinarian appears nowhere on it.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given more specialties than fit one screen, when the page is opened, then all are present and no paging control is offered.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given the page, when it is rendered twice, then the specialties and their veterinarians appear in the same order each time.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given every other page of the system, when it is rendered, then none links to the specialty directory.
+
+**Edge cases:**
+1. A veterinarian holding more than one specialty appears under each of them.
+2. The page carries the same navigation as every other page, to owner search and the veterinarian directory.
+3. The page's wording is bound by `REQ-LANG-002` like any other page's.
+
+**Design:** [system-design.md#contracts](system-design.md#contracts)
+
